        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Charles%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town was officially incorporated by the Lee County Circuit Court on January 10, 1914.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Charles%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2022 the Virginia General Assembly passed a bill terminating Saint Charles’s charter after no one ran for office in two elections.",
