      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Charles%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The town is surrounded on all sides by rugged hills, including Lone Mountain to the northeast and Little Black Mountain to the northwest.",
